{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02939","headline":"奉和圣制送张说巡边 · 崔日用","name":"奉和圣制送张说巡边","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"轩相推风后，周官重夏卿。\n庙谋能允迪，韬略又纵横。\n吉日四黄马，宣王六月兵。\n拟清鸡鹿塞，先指朔方城。\n列将怀威抚，匈奴畏盛名。\n去当推毂送，来伫出郊迎。\n绝漠蓬将断，华筵槿正荣。\n壮心看舞劒，别绪应悬旌。\n睿锡承优旨，乾文复宠行。\n暂劳期永逸，赫矣振天声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔日用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02939.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02939","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}